Original commit body from ced862d:

Migrate Django URL routing detection to the new UsageContext system.
The Python analyzer now emits UsageContext records for path(), re_path(),
and url() calls, which are matched against YAML patterns in django.yaml
during the enrichment phase.

This is the first framework to use usage-based patterns, demonstrating
the v1.1.x pattern matching system for call-based frameworks.
